# Icon Policy - SnapSort App

**Last Updated:** December 2025  
**Status:** Active

---

## 🎯 Current Policy: Use Font Awesome

**ALL new features and components must use Font Awesome icons.**

```dart
import 'package:font_awesome_flutter/font_awesome_flutter.dart';

FaIcon(
  FontAwesomeIcons.house,
  size: 24,
  color: colorScheme.primary,
)
```

---

## ✅ Why Font Awesome?

1. **Comprehensive**: 30,000+ professional icons
2. **Consistent**: All icons follow the same design language
3. **Maintained**: Regularly updated by the Font Awesome team
4. **Easy to use**: No custom SVG management needed
5. **Well documented**: Excellent search and documentation at [fontawesome.com/icons](https://fontawesome.com/icons)

